Identification and Analysis of Risk Sources in Shield Tunneling of Diversion Tunnel
LI Qiang1 LI Ziyang1 XU Linjun2 WANG Yanling3
1.State Key Laboratory of Hydrology-Water Resources and Hydraulic Engineering Nanjing Hydraulic Research Institute Nanjing 210029 China
2.Water Conservancy and Irrigation Area Engineering Construction Administration of Xixiayuan Water Control Project Zhengzhou 450008 China
3.Xuzhou Branch of China South to North Water Transfer Group East Line Co. Ltd. Xuzhou 221002 China
Abstract As the geological environment of the diversion tunnel is changeable and shield construction is a complex construction process the
risk probability is high the risk is difficult to predict and the economic loss and personal injury caused by the risk are immeasurable. Loo
king for and analyzing the possible risk sources in shield construction of diversion tunnel is helpful to ensure the safe construction of tunnel
engineering. In this paper for a diversion tunnel the WBS-RBS method was used to build a risk matrix identify the risk sources of tunnel
shield construction through the study of the matrix and then determined the weight of each risk factor of the tunnel through the Analytic Hier
archy Process obtained the impact degree of each risk factor on the progress of tunnel shield construction and formulated corresponding risk
control measures according to the impact degree so as to provide effective management methods for tunnel shield construction. It made the
safety management of tunnel shield construction from post remediation to pre prevention reduced the probability of risk occurrence and im
proved the level of safety management of tunnel shield construction.
Key words shield construction WBS-RBS risk identification Analytic Hierarchy Process
